  <div class="container">
    <h1>15 Days Great Silk Road: Kashgar to Tashkent</h1>
    <div class="route">📍 Kashgar → Kuqa → Turpan → Urumqi → Tashkent → Samarkand → Bukhara</div>
    <div class="badge-row"><span>🌍 Cross-Border Journey</span><span>⭐ 4-Star Hotels</span><span>🎓 English Guide</span><span>🚄 High-Speed Train</span></div>
